_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Qkiz7nFYML7sJBFPO7pNaw","review_id":"C1FzehxTBpXJZ-Pvmw9QDg","date":"2019-11-22T20:20:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9244807958602905,"text_excerpt":"My work team and I decided to take an off campus lunch and I brought up the idea to go to Munch Factory! First of all, I was excited that the restaurant had returned to the Gentilly area! I was sad when they moved from Elysian and went uptown. However they've redeemed theirselves! =) We were greeted immediately upon walking in and chose where we wanted to sit. Our drinks orders were taken and we scanned the menu while we waited. I ordered the Buffalo Shrimp Wrap with Fries! When my plate came, I was happy to see the buffalo sauce in the side, although I thought the shrimp was tossed in it. No biggie! With Buffalo sauce you need some ranch, so I asked for a side. The wrap it's self was fre..."},{"business_id":"Qkiz7nFYML7sJBFPO7pNaw","review_id":"UrX5k2cgAsQTpNurlUiBWw","date":"2021-06-16T03:05:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9243448376655579,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I decided to hit up an old favorite today, and munched for lunch. Get it? Anyway, they seem to be still operating with a COVID staff, meaning bare bones, so there is a sign posted that says there is no table service. Well lo and behold, the one server/cashier working-Jo I believe was her name- still managed to provide top notch table service so we had to tip her twice. The food is always delicious at Munch, and it did not disappoint today. We had the roast beef debris nachos, buffalo oysters, a Caesar salad, and we each got the crispy chicken sandwich, which was excellent. Pro tip- ask for a little extra buffalo sauce and put a dab on the chicken sandwich. Your taste buds w..."},{"business_id":"Qkiz7nFYML7sJBFPO7pNaw","review_id":"HUcBllf-AnypmGKcPQtY2w","date":"2019-12-10T18:20:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9188278913497925,"text_excerpt":"This is the second location I have been to for Munch Factory. I actually ordered the same dish, Shrimp n Grits with a Worcestershire reduction. It was just as delicious as I had at the other location. There is a beautiful view of the golf course out the window. Service was excellent entry to exit from everyone I interacted with. I was so happy with every aspect of this dining experience."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Qkiz7nFYML7sJBFPO7pNaw","photo_id":"Mwe0ikoiWWHT-wUGkNBvqQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Mwe0ikoiWWHT-wUGkNBvqQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.929074764251709},{"business_id":"Qkiz7nFYML7sJBFPO7pNaw","photo_id":"h8omtTVZ3n7mKDx0JLNPnA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/h8omtTVZ3n7mKDx0JLNPnA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9253469705581665},{"business_id":"Qkiz7nFYML7sJBFPO7pNaw","photo_id":"01syheFc5TB5xGoznWnV1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/01syheFc5TB5xGoznWnV1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9069707989692688},{"business_id":"Qkiz7nFYML7sJBFPO7pNaw","photo_id":"QJ6KJOdiHbZacJ7qBTwqLw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QJ6KJOdiHbZacJ7qBTwqLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8899813294410706}]},"notebook_case":null}
